## Batch

`spec/conformance/charts/spawn-tasks.road:14`

```text
Uploads files side by side, one task per file name, and counts those stored.
```

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  Open: on Add / spawn uploads[event.name] = upload(event.size)
  Open: on Cancel / stop uploads[event.name]
  Open: on uploads.Progress / do showProgress(key, event.percent)
  Open: on uploads.done / set stored = stored + 1, do showStored(key, result)
  Open: on uploads.fail * / do reportFailure(key, error.reason)
  Closed: output stored
  [*] --> Open
  Open --> Closed: Close
  Closed --> [*]
```
